    "ContextMenu.ParameterHelpInterpolated" : {
      "comment" : "Help text explaining how to use captured substrings in a context menu action parameter using interpolated-string syntax; preserve the anchor tags and URLs",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V parametru můžete použít zachycené řetězce z regulárního výrazu chytrého výběru. Použijte \\(matches[i]), kde i=0 je celá shoda a i>0 jsou zachytávací skupiny. Další hodnoty najdete v částech <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> a <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan bruge indfangede strenge fra det regulære udtryk i Smart markering i parameteren. Brug \\(matches[i]), hvor i=0 er hele forekomsten, og i>0 er indfangningsgrupper. Andre værdier finder du i <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> og <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie können aus dem regulären Ausdruck von Smart Selection erfasste Zeichenfolgen im Parameter verwenden. Verwenden Sie \\(matches[i]), wobei i=0 für die gesamte Übereinstimmung und i>0 für Erfassungsgruppen steht. Weitere Werte finden Sie unter <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> und <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\(matches[i]) where i=0 for the entire match and i>0 for capture groups. For other values, see <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> and <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes usar las cadenas capturadas por la expresión regular de la selección inteligente en el parámetro. Usa \\(matches[i]) donde i=0 es la coincidencia completa e i>0 son los grupos de captura. Para otros valores, consulta <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> y <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parametrissa voi käyttää älykkään valinnan säännöllisen lausekkeen kaappaamia merkkijonoja. Käytä \\(matches[i]), missä i=0 on koko osuma ja i>0 ovat kaappausryhmiä. Muita arvoja varten katso <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> ja <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez utiliser dans le paramètre les chaînes capturées par l’expression régulière de la sélection intelligente. Utilisez \\(matches[i]) avec i=0 pour la correspondance entière et i>0 pour les groupes de capture. Pour les autres valeurs, consultez <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> et <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nel parametro puoi usare le stringhe catturate dall’espressione regolare della selezione intelligente. Usa \\(matches[i]) dove i=0 indica l’intera corrispondenza e i>0 i gruppi di cattura. Per altri valori, consulta <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> e <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パラメーターにはSmart Selectionの正規表現でキャプチャした文字列を使用できます。\\(matches[i])を使用してください。i=0は一致全体、i>0はキャプチャグループを表します。その他の値については、<a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a>と<a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>を参照してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "매개변수에서 스마트 선택 정규 표현식의 캡처된 문자열을 사용할 수 있습니다. \\(matches[i])를 사용하며, i=0이면 전체 일치, i>0이면 캡처 그룹입니다. 다른 값에 대해서는 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">스크립팅 기본 사항</a> 및 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">변수 참조(세션 컨텍스트)</a>를 참조하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan bruke fangede strenger fra det regulære uttrykket i Smart markering i parameteren. Bruk \\(matches[i]) der i=0 er hele treffet og i>0 er fangstgrupper. For andre verdier, se <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> og <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je kunt in de parameter vastgelegde tekenreeksen uit de reguliere expressie van de slimme selectie gebruiken. Gebruik \\(matches[i]) waarbij i=0 de hele overeenkomst is en i>0 de vastleggroepen. Zie voor andere waarden <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> en <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W parametrze możesz użyć ciągów przechwyconych przez wyrażenie regularne inteligentnego zaznaczania. Użyj \\(matches[i]), gdzie i=0 oznacza całe dopasowanie, a i>0 grupy przechwytywania. Inne wartości znajdziesz w <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> i <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você pode usar strings capturadas pela expressão regular da seleção inteligente no parâmetro. Use \\(matches[i]) com i=0 para a correspondência inteira e i>0 para grupos de captura. Para outros valores, consulte <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> e <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вы можете использовать захваченные строки из регулярного выражения функции «Умное выделение» в параметре. Используйте \\(matches[i]), где i=0 означает всё совпадение целиком, а i>0 — группы захвата. Дополнительные сведения см. в разделах <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> и <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V parametri môžete použiť zachytené reťazce z regulárneho výrazu inteligentného výberu. Použite \\(matches[i]), kde i=0 je celá zhoda a i>0 sú zachytávacie skupiny. Ďalšie hodnoty nájdete v <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> a <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V parametru lahko uporabite zajete nize iz regularnega izraza pametnega izbora. Uporabite \\(matches[i]), kjer je i=0 celotno ujemanje, i>0 pa zajemalne skupine. Za druge vrednosti glejte <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> in <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan använda fångade strängar från Smart markerings reguljära uttryck i parametern. Använd \\(matches[i]) där i=0 är hela träffen och i>0 är fångstgrupper. För andra värden, se <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> och <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parametrede Akıllı Seçim’in düzenli ifadesinden yakalanan dizeleri kullanabilirsiniz. Tüm eşleşme için i=0, yakalama grupları için i>0 olacak şekilde \\(matches[i]) kullanın. Diğer değerler için <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> ve <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a> sayfalarına bakın."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bạn có thể dùng các chuỗi được bắt từ biểu thức chính quy của Chọn thông minh trong tham số. Dùng \\(matches[i]) với i=0 cho toàn bộ kết quả khớp và i>0 cho các nhóm bắt. Với các giá trị khác, xem <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> và <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可以在参数中使用 Smart Selection 正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\(matches[i])，其中 i=0 表示整个匹配项，i>0 表示捕获组。其他值请参考 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> 和 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在參數中使用智慧型選取之正規表示式所擷取的字串。使用 \\(matches[i])，其中 i=0 代表整個符合項目，i>0 代表擷取群組。其他值請參閱 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> 和 <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ContextMenu.ParameterHelpPlain" : {
      "comment" : "Help text explaining how to use captured substrings in a context menu action parameter, non-interpolated syntax",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V parametru můžete použít zachycené řetězce z regulárního výrazu chytrého výběru. Použijte \\0 pro shodu, \\1…\\9 pro skupiny shody, \\d pro adresář, \\u pro uživatele a \\h pro hostitele."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan bruge indfangede strenge fra det regulære udtryk i Smart markering i parameteren. Brug \\0 for forekomsten, \\1…\\9 for forekomstgrupper, \\d for mappe, \\u for bruger og \\h for vært."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie können aus dem regulären Ausdruck von Smart Selection erfasste Zeichenfolgen im Parameter verwenden. Verwenden Sie \\0 für die Übereinstimmung, \\1…\\9 für Übereinstimmungsgruppen, \\d für das Verzeichnis, \\u für den Benutzer, \\h für den Host."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\0 for match, \\1…\\9 for match groups, \\d for directory, \\u for user, \\h for host."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes usar las cadenas capturadas por la expresión regular de la selección inteligente en el parámetro. Usa \\0 para la coincidencia, \\1…\\9 para los grupos de coincidencia, \\d para el directorio, \\u para el usuario y \\h para el host."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parametrissa voi käyttää älykkään valinnan säännöllisen lausekkeen kaappaamia merkkijonoja. Käytä \\0 osumalle, \\1…\\9 osumaryhmille, \\d hakemistolle, \\u käyttäjälle ja \\h palvelimelle."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez utiliser dans le paramètre les chaînes capturées par l’expression régulière de la sélection intelligente. Utilisez \\0 pour la correspondance, \\1…\\9 pour les groupes de correspondance, \\d pour le répertoire, \\u pour l’utilisateur, \\h pour l’hôte."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nel parametro puoi usare le stringhe catturate dall’espressione regolare della selezione intelligente. Usa \\0 per la corrispondenza, \\1…\\9 per i gruppi, \\d per la directory, \\u per l’utente, \\h per l’host."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パラメーターにはSmart Selectionの正規表現でキャプチャした文字列を使用できます。\\0は一致全体、\\1…\\9は一致グループ、\\dはディレクトリ、\\uはユーザー、\\hはホストを表します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "매개변수에 스마트 선택 정규 표현식에서 캡처한 문자열을 사용할 수 있습니다. 일치 항목 전체는 \\0, 일치 그룹은 \\1…\\9, 디렉토리는 \\d, 사용자는 \\u, 호스트는 \\h를 사용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan bruke fangede strenger fra det regulære uttrykket i Smart markering i parameteren. Bruk \\0 for treffet, \\1…\\9 for treffgrupper, \\d for mappe, \\u for bruker og \\h for vert."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je kunt in de parameter vastgelegde tekenreeksen uit de reguliere expressie van de slimme selectie gebruiken. Gebruik \\0 voor de overeenkomst, \\1…\\9 voor groepen, \\d voor de map, \\u voor de gebruiker en \\h voor de host."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W parametrze możesz użyć ciągów przechwyconych przez wyrażenie regularne inteligentnego zaznaczania. Użyj \\0 dla dopasowania, \\1…\\9 dla grup dopasowania, \\d dla katalogu, \\u dla użytkownika, \\h dla hosta."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
